 * that distinct movements never share a description (e.g. "Dumbbell Curls" and
 * "Concentration Curls" describe different movements and must not read the same).
 *
 * Exercises outside this pool (user-created customs) fall back to the generic
 * cascade in [com.grafizum.repio.ui.components.getExerciseDetails].
 */
